# Generated bundles: keep the exact committed bytes on checkout.
# With core.autocrlf on Windows the working copy was CRLF while `npm run build`
# rewrites LF, so `git status` reported client.js/index.js as modified even though
# `git diff` was empty. Marking them binary-text-disabled pins the checkout to
# the indexed bytes and the phantom modification disappears.
client.js -text
index.js -text
